{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1394,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8113284ca2fae77dbe742fed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4d6b03bd154c61528a6ff585cc73255cc037d464a40bc413424b69ee800414f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60e4a6aa453a3310393b82a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慢慢来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5084368f99e63a645ad7c5b357e4c57ef2ae9b1a6591e21af4ab154eb0a9c33c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc0f2f7863e680ee71e0da0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d27fba32b4cdf632760230caaf4b4d14ee3299721f6e4c735d9a42b03bba61e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eb900a94302752901fcb92b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被讨厌了啊～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f6de1af3ecc8019b8a298e7474c9850a34cfaff11a5e4e217c279f7fc41dbf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80577b42faec64ece59ecd02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说明天的奖励是这个喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7340d91123cfdcbd1efaadd771712fb8238e23535c72ee6dac3ed272bafea809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d84972163f9ed1ead41f7c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样……真的还能训练吗？\r\n抱歉，我觉得脚有点沉重。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b68eeda12d6cc665bf3c86f51c1c236b2b970b26a41af6c5f1c6de6d24d08b9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:530899939c225da9c48a12a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呃～逃离不了疲劳的感觉。\r\n甚至觉得想请假……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18911c8e125218eff1bf53f23b38d21532a28a0f2658e2842df258bbf3100f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed287cd30e7086219348406",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我彷佛可以无限跑下去！\r\n我要用爆速领头……不，\r\n用神速领头超越昨天的自己一步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07c52092080eb49b31647751843f4e7697936a25089469b255d835e934c16a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd6f0a6546844b6e516cf0c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在真的超兴奋的啦～！\r\n用高尔夫球赛来比喻的话，\r\n就是绝对能打出超高分！",
      "source_fingerprint": "668964c352093d52e7f0bddf325106958bbcab6fc7fc3b1697654664268024da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:854a5f0874880076f51a2d3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦啦～♪\r\n精神状态绝佳！\r\n要先从哪种训练做起呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "02747af05b38f6e3e2c4826d02d4fa69a54f2cdaadf2ffb6dbbb760f5412a75e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1a73ec00017d3f1a54d2bed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～其他选手们都很努力呢！\r\n看到这状况，连自己\r\n都会跟着嗨起来呢……很好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6046a588fa7ce3139359d9b4a686238cc2bef6b829a62244e81aada52886ad7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:882bb91c9d5da1fa9e9ed29f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好很好～不错！\r\n善信该努力时也是会好好表现的喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ab23e9ed6bbda65521fd7ce9a8c39c8efd6a06c1a91cf0ced6be5549eb5c051",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ee3628f39344c0486ac2e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该来做什么呢？看刚刚的表现，\r\n不管做什么应该都能得心应手吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e849743ff2252175251502a041c2dce3b9d6948891e246d353b43f856940b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a5b4e29c5ad49272d5695be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时总会莫名地想干脆\r\n放空脑袋只顾埋头挖地洞呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b6d985eb5cab9fbeb97ef32886a4c478e8d4ba6aa7168e1a84591000a978108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa368b4411f29f9c9e4f128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑到哪里去啦～？\r\n善信的干劲启动开关～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf20b8ac61c23c107e65a3798410a2a422d848d74ff7b995c8da7ba7e3da4517",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fa725b3958c5bcd1224d6a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这时就该说……那个……咦？\r\n哇喔～？……我不行了。\r\n现在完全无法思考。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b429122966b97a264077d0284408874258e07c2df1b64c833e7703875b0957af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35434b875608d2763d84c298",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样是无法自由奔跑的……\r\n虽然我理智上很清楚，但是……\r\n我真是丢人啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02bbf04ed3b488ac38b46cadb36655f2598ade2317c5462541a853d65de05731",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:261b1c73f4bc7150dbae636b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我猜啦，或者根本也不用猜啦，\r\n比赛太多了吧？\r\n真希望能减少一点啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7577d357bc142048e563cfbf50b2a01c8edd414f662ef7d9e2c6fd5d8f5569d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2c505eccbc54f402a81fd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参赛次数也太多了吧？\r\n就连善信我也快投降了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "05b3b5687c73b69765a84b80e7ec3d82d90d641aa522c16bf37676af7ff91214",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7736ea52a2b574423337ea94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "事事万全，简直太～赞啦！\r\n你很行嘛，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7019bebd0dadea46c5f65c6d66481756defce7f5d986e6f70c1d43245e67bc13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92a91cb5132a5ab0b1106e6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来今天也没什么人盯着我呢～\r\n既然这样，我干脆\r\n拿出全力甩开所有人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "086327572dae42ef658123359758dae1aae56f4bc57b4d86596c615f9503ec31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e28e647e6d3a3be99acc31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有种预感，\r\n今天一定可以用自己的方式，\r\n无比自由地比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52d4dee0ff9283579c942258a42bc1b263c4055577e9df94ef931d2ffad5b747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33a18d97927816f1e121cd58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况怎么样啊？训练员？\r\n善信可是状态绝佳～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28096b9a2df2f7abb4c2491e0b3707eb9ce3f6b4821359653c91f0b506616509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0c633a97cbd0fef0274afd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～这股兴奋感！\r\n忍不住想立刻开跑的感觉！\r\n比赛前就该这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdc71fae15b9db6c8f9427bbb7b9e648e1ec17ad8473c1b237a5ba587686ff64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e266a6667ffa7e29c5c74d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等下优胜后受访，\r\n拍照时该摆什么姿势呢～？\r\n……呃，我想太远了吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f52e09b7d46f15fadcbd3257616ebfaf96a7c7c5f2f996a886102ba699e0b21b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e809b25425eab703ba4182",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回复完加油信息了～！\r\n嗯，这下可不能输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61e6d5ed0e42f29d938a1d9cde7ffefa1ecc4eb8441b3262adc16ee7809dc0b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46c378691cd35bbdb6f7c82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你相信着我对吧？\r\n那我也相信自己做得到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd0742a98a1c607085a5c3e805371caa15980d789403e80ac96d0b93407156bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:189bef2995f1a9fea847fa2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑在最前头时最开心，\r\n会感到心情超级激昂！\r\n嗯，绝不将那里让给任何人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a03e82871c66540d4ffae181d7850c22cb79e3fcdbba9312d9ef3cbf0fabd85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9dface725562c5cdf03a31f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大事不妙的时候才更该露出笑容！\r\n快点，训练员你也笑一个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e9a596409324123ec60a906873a79360f0e11a8348a63f385b2977dfea04a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2538275c329c1e8444321a2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情彷佛明天要开学了但暑假作业\r\n还没做完。只能干脆接受事实了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5034f26a9d0f876617f4a31bff5445f20af85b1bcd2899a656e9b44aaf586c74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b10a03e0cda880be764f61a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回想我的竞赛生涯，\r\n一直都是逆境。事到如今，\r\n我才不会就这样退缩呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08de3472679523f357167ddc32b5527b1d22a59685fbc4c7c0892538bf9c4e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb4fa4145250c053aad0608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～怎么会这样。\r\n不过我会做好所有该做的事。\r\n因为我不想让胜利从手中逃走嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3f60983bc0a7856c8ad9622e5fc77770792be5c20c32961b32be105eb9f13f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6444c8ef41de23af366dc76d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管这条路多险峻，\r\n终究还是通向目的地，对吧？\r\n那就只能前进了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4d03578639e8e926f818c4cc3da52698330c693b775e18a85b27f7ad4cf841c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4ac5999ecda622dfc3b152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经不在乎是好是坏。\r\n因为自己如果辜负人们对\r\n「善信」的声援，就是NG的……!",
      "source_fingerprint": "889845a3e2e3713976346627394d7a896fba2a8a99ab9c896d40bf0c9bcd4499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887afd38ab8b8f7f72e9b126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6e8ddf78ab96962ce0d078439426606da213fa68482b193399045a60f7c142",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d7a9cfb55098cfa6f49885",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大闹一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0562b667bd7a6654fca33d90a2d0eba13d0af30b6ed6ac92c9648f06a577fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:475071aab7817b449d73bc69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我办得到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "221df05255cdc50af14c8eb96e043d97d0a1183adb20d7e340414048e1008996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b6da027528f072ffaaf9360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？我看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "947a61a326137f08d9c1308f87ce7645dda9b43c570c0d770259fc228a43aefa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19679b9d10709731c1975794",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2fc41fc2a37ee08441f40c67d9ba7a9c82aa96fa79524ef44330e764709db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8dc907e808c5e06317dc663",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我认输了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cd5cba4e8ca616b4a6588b0d10a70495d97ae5837d785c5cfc648b4eddb2a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd414116abc6cd7383a233e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧走吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1f818f7ec0344e41504fbb0fea0e37b480c0946360da4f4773ffb6ac404c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f3bc835dc86548e56ee417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好棒的海！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a8676add9c421c5dac028e81309b7d8847e3add5ace160834af31b69a203858",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7603d7c7ada4dd306a9e9468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢啦～真是美好的青春啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b383bab2676b61fcaca289f6937b71d984237bdc84c62b7e6beefb78b810fc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15626efaef877681d500f944",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e341b37152f4d4f3ba56e10fd6a64c90c6b82a1b5259828ca89442a02e66bd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1991a3aca00ec576859ca20a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK，走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0904a40bcb6ae4b9ce6b8add43f1b510d1a02a5d2d6bec2749323ec5fc42c192",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6139e7a8b336c48fb192aaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62553cd5b7ca118ad290d0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，嗨起来喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5071036c5a40ae18b6057b41cea7ef4b5c6e1cea46809fc08cfd6a33eb4a9b52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b7019b520a1d7600d17af82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e341b37152f4d4f3ba56e10fd6a64c90c6b82a1b5259828ca89442a02e66bd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2f0eb3ebdac6c8c73925d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等下优胜后受访，\r\n拍照时该摆什么姿势呢～？\r\n……呃，我想太远了吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f52e09b7d46f15fadcbd3257616ebfaf96a7c7c5f2f996a886102ba699e0b21b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8e61fdc1b9ac52ebc831b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有种预感，\r\n今天一定可以用自己的方式，\r\n无比自由地比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52d4dee0ff9283579c942258a42bc1b263c4055577e9df94ef931d2ffad5b747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9efa6dd7565bf6bfd317f8e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e341b37152f4d4f3ba56e10fd6a64c90c6b82a1b5259828ca89442a02e66bd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b81c97a1d9b9eba9a69963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりますか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b52a1f593af23d2907c6ebdf7d6aa66d9e1fdcd1d24b7dc708a0e2722a77a357",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8675bfbe7dcdca835dd6900f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "优胜从手中逃走了……嗯，下一场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e171bb12284cfad3928c20a4b1ee9eeea785bdc8e35b798642f956021c286f0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27cc741267bdc3e7597208d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这成果就像是高尔夫的最近洞吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1505bb2b29cf2f47573b28da635f6304dc18da108deac58dd9b7a750ccefcea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbca42db8dea3a1adb1db721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来可得嗨起来啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7ec1540235b88d41cece63819b45f622b9fa6d3a66369c7f44ddcfe6874955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82ec0ba6b6aa53e3f251c8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～真是的！我在搞什么啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba875900491a42b420a877c19e694dffbcdf21c5b4d3e600c3a8356b782ab52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:456cf3b38bc057eb96daa733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不得了吧？\r\n这就是我的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "886b123934701be44ff9d125e9e3a18218d029210f0d0cadfed72ac74c852b1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fa6a0374daedfbcd2eb303f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶──！我真有一套！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b00cdd4a735b7318697b8fc809f0dbdc6bb953cecb92821c3c9df0c312fa9e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:603237ca7868fa478ac01179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "運んできたよ～、私たちの勝利をっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e08e4fbf9d72c3881861cbdfd5bddf174ebbde103a968e738109d0300e5188fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a73bdffe6ae03c7c5a10a2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イェーイ！私やるぅ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f66908800a6d942c53f7474c403c9644349cbffc80eddf4132c745537e7760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084d411e56cc5163dcb56d2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要出招啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c44ba7695c4e0b3a6c6568c8548cc965184b86f84849f3496fc4b3d34291b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a21f57733c71d0e8a94bada",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要抓住属于我的自由！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bcd27feaa72ece3079a4d4093a4b076f544c5ca4cb96082ab856aba9eb467c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfe82c37135d789a60bda8e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参考までにヘリオスにクリパ案\r\n聞いてみたらさ…ラップバトルて。\r\nいや～、それやったら勇者でしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f75285fc2cfbf573e4d11df56f739f0a6faead445684c38bf836263b77798dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d534fc4d418fdc4a39890fd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你说休息也很重要？说得也是！\r\n那就尽全力休息吧！\r\n该怎么装潢魔王城呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "db990bc88633a38dcd45cad42cae34a4edcd0a6ac68dcb461dc774bd51634b32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02e266a7bb56127b32f9cf74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐姐，要不要和我一起玩啊？\r\n……太轻浮了？欸，和我一起……\r\n做遍夏天的开心事吧……也不对？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e38b5ae6973b0c33743649cfab2f5bec3c69c295d93d28a2ba2664001dd8844",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a421f772d7f3a63b26b23a05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是朋友啊，也分成很多种……\r\n但对我来说都是相当重要的存在，\r\n因为能够让我保持理想的自己呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80fb0cff08a7e0a42dfa4082be5b2568986b6bd740f8a9fbae6681e44965022a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbea2f09431f815685066ced",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耍任性看似简单，\r\n其实很需要勇气呢。\r\n……风风果然很厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8c11612c5772200158cf3f5843ab5d00d2ea353ba756771ff784211b12931d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e8412fd1ff9c10669e85d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メジロ家に風穴開けられたかな？\r\n…私だから、できたんだよね。\r\nやってやったぞー！あははははっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ccbd7720e4875c922069269eca6009892e8aaf1c93f5f37d3ffae54d19d71f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9255e53134a4416e2982390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝啊啊！……我一定要……克服！\r\n我要……获得……自由……啊啊啊！\r\n哈哈，怎么样啊……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e771cce050d0c5ffe8b34a904750d9e61588df31a68ac9dd7e1bf258accc282a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31801ba64cfc3756eeffac37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリパはこっからっしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c46d13e31648149aa8ff598b141dd6065da2236402304b6fc922c711a92ced6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5775a1f5dbd212086d63310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メリクリー！はーい、おかわりどうぞー！\r\nお！となり失礼♪じゃ、改めて…メリクリ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68599862a811796a5c39033652012e15c9379cda513d1913d11a38b8ad9a23bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09399b615f500efbf98ce5fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通常版メジロカレンダーは勝負服で\r\n撮ったんだ！…限定版がほしい？\r\nならクリスマス・ナイトにおいで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "559c90c139b8b5bc57dbf63fb717b9167719df7d4d3fe473d3fdaa3a9e550a90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "400064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b928645ab7dbeb33c1adc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶耶～♪\r\n我要来一场最棒的演唱会表演喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c48faf5abcdbe7b471c8b9f29921c69ffbc8f2786b64e8da32353c5fb542c65a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:949149061d850adb2662fa28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信已经\r\n整个嗨起来啰♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7ebdc693b69e790803c7f8b9e155779e040403b0e492ccf29b79611261210b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0879182b352acd0955b380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，就放轻松一点吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c7bb1e4d35312ff4f8c9209114dd716f49bfaf064654b474d3d69cfe7359f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3548f0a0533fb048fda5258b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当时我是担心你才会向你搭话。\r\n但现在你已经是个出色的\r\n训练员了呢……啊哈哈♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1aaf59fb8030a9a02b11dcd5c0e6847ad43a0d99947be36e9b86b4955bb0979",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ece512700dd8aab5ea9ddcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很适合吧～\r\n正式服装也不赖呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "605cc077165de15fd03576c50604d8129bee4307a9360db06c458cbb15a8aa2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac5a993734b5192f235cccec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唱歌跳舞的善信！\r\n要为台上的我加油喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b94844b6a7d1e2883b09be0f9c822493df69eb470cd921b8e58d40fe0fa352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ccb9f10efc3b649668deac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样啊？美国风格♪\r\n果然令人感到很嗨呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31ab87edbcfb8292663e7104df8a649850b0afa54a1e6da8267ef9f3ebcf9d47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dee63f45568353203b826161",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怪了，衣服上的折痕呢？\r\n我明明折出线后熨烫过的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "982cf5d08894007f0b259a5829a842305fceeb5ef382b27fded1341126e714ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70010"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
